{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1064003001:0":{"text":"总算解决了……沙虫铠甲好硬，爆炸魔法竟然都伤不到它……","source_cn":"总算解决了……沙虫铠甲好硬，爆炸魔法竟然都伤不到它……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5B46363BCA87CB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064003002:1":{"text":"毕竟是我们荒角沙漠的沙王——萨纳斯潘特。","source_cn":"毕竟是我们荒角沙漠的沙王——萨纳斯潘特。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9AA036FAC3B51C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064003003:1":{"text":"也算是传说级别的怪物了！","source_cn":"也算是传说级别的怪物了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1AF09129948ED766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064003004:1":{"text":"好厉害的名字，可以记下来当命名参考。","source_cn":"好厉害的名字，可以记下来当命名参考。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xB525689A1E1CFE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064003005:1":{"text":"……什么东西才会用到这种名字啊。","source_cn":"……什么东西才会用到这种名字啊。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4FF1ECA200EEE442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064003006:1":{"text":"嘿，你们好！","source_cn":"嘿，你们好！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x6CF25B43D049DD55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064003007:1":{"text":"我是阿尔萨，他是索恩！我们来自乌尔氏族！","source_cn":"我是阿尔萨，他是索恩！我们来自乌尔氏族！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3775674741BDC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064003008:1":{"text":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAB875630BCCB4DC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1064003008":{"text":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","source_cn":"梅林大人，好久不见！他们是你的新同伴吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAB875630BCCB4DC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064003009:1":{"text":"哇！另一个世界也太酷了！有迷宫和各种魔物啊……","source_cn":"哇！另一个世界也太酷了！有迷宫和各种魔物啊……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC3BF317A9A000D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064003010:1":{"text":"你们怎么会来荒角沙漠？","source_cn":"你们怎么会来荒角沙漠？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xABE93E157D272C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064003011:1":{"text":"我们来找远古生物骨骼，有了它说不定我们就能回去了。","source_cn":"我们来找远古生物骨骼，有了它说不定我们就能回去了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5BA929E05933B18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064003012:1":{"text":"那你们真是来对地方啦！我们知道哪里有最古老的骨骼，对吧...","source_cn":"那你们真是来对地方啦！我们知道哪里有最古老的骨骼，对吧...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064003013:1":{"text":"嗯，老爹提过。","source_cn":"嗯，老爹提过。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3A30A33452320430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064003014:1":{"text":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064003014":{"text":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","source_cn":"既然如此，我们分头行动。我带你们去找骨骼！索恩——","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x24251A47C32299BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064003015:1":{"text":"那就先跟我们回部落里休整吧，正好尝尝这个大沙虫！","source_cn":"那就先跟我们回部落里休整吧，正好尝尝这个大沙虫！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB9F03D07549C40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064003016:1":{"text":"呃，不保证味道！因为我们也是第一次吃……","source_cn":"呃，不保证味道！因为我们也是第一次吃……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7CED5A4E81F36F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064003017:0":{"text":"你们没有吃过吗？我还以为这是这里常见的食物。","source_cn":"你们没有吃过吗？我还以为这是这里常见的食物。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xED70AF30AAB4FF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064003018:1":{"text":"不是啦，沙虫很难打的。一般我们都是躲着走。","source_cn":"不是啦，沙虫很难打的。一般我们都是躲着走。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7FF9468BC9608D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064003019:1":{"text":"但最近似乎是沙虫的求偶期……","source_cn":"但最近似乎是沙虫的求偶期……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x8270F3038493B055","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064003020:0":{"text":"它的活动范围和脾气都变大了！","source_cn":"它的活动范围和脾气都变大了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4E819A1DA6D60380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064003021:0":{"text":"幸亏有你们在，不然我们肯定遭殃啦！","source_cn":"幸亏有你们在，不然我们肯定遭殃啦！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAE13735E0F5278FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064003022:0":{"text":"日头越来越大了，边走边说。","source_cn":"日头越来越大了，边走边说。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE60BD5F5514876C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:31:1064003023:1":{"text":"你们合力将巨大的沙虫运回了乌尔氏族的绿洲。森西和莱欧斯...","source_cn":"你们合力将巨大的沙虫运回了乌尔氏族的绿洲。森西和莱欧斯...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064003024:1":{"text":"真是奇特的生物，生活在沙漠，但是外壳结构却像是甲壳类的...","source_cn":"真是奇特的生物，生活在沙漠，但是外壳结构却像是甲壳类的...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064003025:1":{"text":"那么，根据结构得在甲壳接缝处下刀，老夫先试试看……","source_cn":"那么，根据结构得在甲壳接缝处下刀，老夫先试试看……","