","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064003055:1":{"text":"当然了，这都多亏了森西！","source_cn":"当然了，这都多亏了森西！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x61E9C4A1DCB86140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064003056:1":{"text":"老夫只是觉得……无论身在哪里，吃好饭都是很重要的事情。","source_cn":"老夫只是觉得……无论身在哪里，吃好饭都是很重要的事情。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x48F58DED1C238222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:87:1064003057:1":{"text":"篝火旁，你们享用着美食，并分享着各自的冒险故事，直到深夜……","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_legacy_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:71:0:1":{"text":"尝了才知道，不如先试试？","source_cn":"尝了才知道，不如先试试？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE19C2AC31FAFCDB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"尝了才知道，不如先试试？","female":"尝了才知道，不如先试试？","variant_male_record_index":"60396","variant_female_record_index":"60397","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:57:0:1":{"text":"还有我","source_cn":"还有我","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x987F019817D3F75F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"还有我","female":"还有我","variant_male_record_index":"60394","variant_female_record_index":"60395","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti